                    "line": 48,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Mayank Metha D",
                        "email": "mayank.metha@intel.com",
                        "username": "mmetha"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you provide a list of possible values and what each value indicates?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-aspeed/recipes-aspeed/images/aspeed-image-manifest/ast2700-default-manifest.toml",
                    "line": 48,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vince Chang",
                        "email": "vince_chang@aspeedtech.com",
                        "username": "VinceChang6637"
                    },
                    "message": "Flag used by FMC (BootMCU runtime) to determine how the image is loaded in the main boot flow:\n\u2022 0: Used only by specific drivers (e.g., ddr_xx.bin)\n\u2022 1: May be loaded by the main boot flow (e.g., atf.bin)\n\u2022 2: Used for the next-stage booting (iRoT solution)\nRefer to https://github.com/AspeedTech-BMC/cptra_imgtool#image-metadata-list-1."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-aspeed/recipes-aspeed/images/aspeed-image-manifest/ast2700-default-manifest.toml",
                    "line": 48,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vince Chang",
                        "email": "vince_chang@aspeedtech.com",
                        "username": "VinceChang6637"
                    },
                    "message": "Change to resolved."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-aspeed/recipes-aspeed/images/aspeed-image-manifest/ast2700-default-manifest.toml",
                    "line": 121,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Mayank Metha D",
                        "email": "mayank.metha@intel.com",
                        "username": "mmetha"
                    },
                    "message": "If there is no file then can this metadata list item be removed?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-aspeed/recipes-aspeed/images/aspeed-image-manifest/ast2700-default-manifest.toml",
                    "line": 121,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vince Chang",
                        "email": "vince_chang@aspeedtech.com",
                        "username": "VinceChang6637"
                    },
                    "message": "No, currently it cannot be removed.\nIf you want to remove an image from the manifest or flash layout, please locate the corresponding metadata entry and set file = \"\" and load_stage = 0.\n\n\nRefer to https://github.com/AspeedTech-BMC/cptra_imgtool#image-metadata-list-1."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-aspeed/recipes-aspeed/images/aspeed-image-manifest/ast2700-default-manifest.toml",
                    "line": 128,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Mayank Metha D",
                        "email": "mayank.metha@intel.com",
                        "username": "mmetha"
                    },
                    "message": "If there is no image then can this metadata list item be removed?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-aspeed/recipes-aspeed/images/aspeed-image-manifest/ast2700-default-manifest.toml",
                    "line": 128,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vince Chang",
                        "email": "vince_chang@aspeedtech.com",
                        "username": "VinceChang6637"
                    },
                    "message": "No, currently it cannot be removed.\nIf you want to remove an image from the manifest or flash layout, please locate the corresponding metadata entry and set file = \"\" and load_stage = 0.\n\n\nRefer to https://github.com/AspeedTech-BMC/cptra_imgtool#image-metadata-list-1."
                }
            ],
